# Environment variables for S3 Storage Viewer.
# Copy this file to your local, gitignored env file and fill it in.

# REQUIRED — the app will not run without these two:
APP_PASSWORD=
APP_SECRET=
#   APP_PASSWORD : the password entered at /login — at least 8 characters, with at least
#                  one number and one letter.
#   APP_SECRET   : MUST be more than 24 characters with at least 4 digits and 4 special
#                  characters (a long passphrase, e.g. "Tr0ub4dour&3-Horse$Battery!Staple").
#                  Random hex/base64 has no symbols and will be rejected. Secures the
#                  auth cookie AND encrypts saved S3 credentials.

# OPTIONAL — a default S3 bucket. Provide ALL FOUR for a default connection, or NONE
# and connect a bucket from the in-app form after login (add/switch anytime via the
# top-right switcher). Partial config counts as no default.
AWS_REGION=
S3_BUCKET=
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
